    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d690">

                <pb facs="0984" n="974" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg974"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/8–1545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-15T20:00:00+03:00">August 15, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 15—4:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2918. Soong left Moscow this morning at 10 o’clock directly for Washington. All
                    the agreements were signed last night.<anchor n="23" xml:id="d690-f1"/> Molotov
                    was at the airfield with the guard of honor to see him off.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harriman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
